<title>SLOVAKIA: Slovak FinMin sets bond/T-bill auctions for Q1.</title>
<headline>Slovak FinMin sets bond/T-bill auctions for Q1.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-01-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovak Finance Ministry on Thursday announced its planned scheduled for issuing treasury bills and state bonds in the first quarter of 1997:</p>
<p> Issue	  Date of auction  Maturity	Maturity Date</p>
<p> T-bill	 January   8	Four weeks    February 6</p>
<p> T-bill	 January  15	Four weeks    February 13</p>
<p> T-bill	 January  22	Three months  April 24</p>
<p> State bond   January  28	Four years    January 31, 2001</p>
<p> T-bill	 February  5	Four weeks    March 6</p>
<p> T-bill	 February 12	Four weeks    March 13</p>
<p> T-bill	 February 19	Three months  May 22</p>
<p> State bond   February 26	Four years    February 28, 2001</p>
<p> T-bill	 March  5	   Four weeks    April 3</p>
<p> T-bill	 March 12	   Four weeks    April 10</p>
<p> T-bill	 March 19	   Eight weeks   May 15</p>
<p> State bond   March 26	   Five years    March 27, 2002</p>
<p>-- Bratislava Newsroom, 42-7-563-3687</p>
</text>
